    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d657">

                <pb facs="0850" n="838" sameAs="frus:frus1946v07/pg838"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">767.68119/8–1246: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1946-08-13T19:00:00-04:00">August 13, 1946—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>577. Dept giving close study to Soviet note Aug 7 and appreciates helpful
                    comments urtels 853 Aug 10 and 856 Aug 12. In view magnitude issues involved
                    Dept has requested War and Navy comment<anchor n="59" xml:id="d657-f1"/> and is
                    awaiting this and outcome Secstate’s conversations with Bevin in Paris (see
                    London’s 63 Aug 13 to Ankara<anchor n="60" xml:id="d657-f2"/>) before
                    instructing you re US views.</p>
                <p>Sent Ankara 577, rptd Paris 4062, London 6012, and Moscow 1481.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d657-f1" n="59" xml:id="d657-f1-content">
                <p>Department’s letters dated August 13 not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d657-f2" n="60" xml:id="d657-f2-content">
                <p>Sent as telegram 7418 to the Department, not printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
